    "name": "blog-analyze",
    "description": "Audit and score blog posts on a 5-category 100-point scoring system covering content quality, SEO optimization, E-E-A-T signals, technical elements, and AI citation readiness. Includes AI content detection (burstiness, phrase flagging, vocabulary diversity). Supports export formats (markdown, JSON, table) and batch analysis with sorting. Generates prioritized recommendations (Critical/High/Medium/Low) with specific fixes. Works with any format (MDX, markdown, HTML, URL). Use when user says \"analyze blog\", \"audit blog\", \"blog score\", \"check blog quality\", \"blog review\", \"rate this blog\", \"blog health check\".\n",
